          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akatemba orusozi orw'emiti Oliva, kunu narra, atajwaire enkaito, ayeswekeriire omutwe; n'abantu boona abaakaba ainabo, baayeswekerra emitwe, baagenda nibarra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi obubaamugambiire ngu: Ahisofeeri nuwe omu ha bantu abaayekobere na Abusalomu, yayesengereza MUKAMA naagamba ati: “Ai MUKAMA, nkwesengeriize, amagezi ga Ahisofeeri ogafoole budoma.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
